{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5d67fe7eceea31e2a4cb0b5b90ea0d675162520d277aeacf6fedf6e9e282cbdd", "ja": "『ガーデン』着任から1ヶ月後。実戦を経て\n着実に戦果を重ねるイクだったが、有人機は\n撃破できずにいた。その甘さを戒めつつも、\nシホはイクの高すぎる適合率に疑問を抱いて\nいた。", "zh": "加入《花园》1个月后。经历实战后不断取得战果的育，却始终没能击破有人机。志保在告诫她不可如此天真的同时，也对育高得过分的适配率抱有疑问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a6737c73a8a3664cd691c82ba99be23ff45fb7955bbac988ce2a6eed2e734a83", "ja": "Archival record 002\n-2 months ago-　2ヶ月前", "zh": "Archival record 002\n-2 months ago-　2个月前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "be90fa5bb9548514a9ba9c2681de058b78531aa6c25dc7979cfb7447a52db49c", "ja": "作戦圏内に敵性反応なし。……ふう。\nみんな、ちゃんと生きてるよね。お疲れ様！", "zh": "作战范围内没有发现敌对反应。……呼。\n大家，都还好好活着吧。辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "ab53aa280544fcb1613169edb4628b0e1bfab070a4cdaeb3ff40004b02d4297d", "ja": "イクちゃん、すごい！　27機、撃墜！\nアーマーの性能をここまで引き出せるなんて……！", "zh": "小育，太厉害了！击坠27架！\n竟然能把装甲的性能发挥到这种程度……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "85a2afed9df02eb8dcc90bb94de0b048dec273f030bfc91e0b1f1e81451ce46d", "ja": "エミリーちゃんの支援のおかげだよ。\n指示と弾幕のおかげで、安心して狙えたから。", "zh": "多亏了艾米莉的支援。\n有她的指示和弹幕，我才能放心瞄准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "b6d36a6daecf4779b0ba50a3f801f5587ff2c1018d0301c500627f0ff6134e78", "ja": "でも、やっぱりミキさんはすごいよね！\n82機も撃墜したんでしょ？", "zh": "不过，美希姐姐果然还是很厉害呢！击落了82架，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "8f8f217e98ade32da0c9e8fd04ffb17cc0dc08bea40e4c1dcd6f934b6a0c63aa", "ja": "ミキさんは特別だから。機兵の次の動きが\n感じ取れるんだって。だから先を読めるの。", "zh": "因为美希是特别的。据说她能察觉到机兵接下来的动作，所以能预判先机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "259e8d5561d7181e3b215f3bc13823fadbe8b06f92e85ab01921fab3cd5156bf", "ja": "あんなに機兵が嫌いなのに……、ね。", "zh": "明明那么讨厌机兵……真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "7560f938d9820b9e39d78b9cfb992256e76cc5d636c12091bcac33445f091c3a", "ja": "みんな聞いて。\n今日の相手が誰だったかハッキリしたわ。", "zh": "大家听我说。\n今天的对手到底是谁，已经查清楚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "3918d51afe16fddc20c187287b37c860310ecde5e0de3a9bcc2ac92e8372db9e", "ja": "『テンタクルス』、フロンティアの独立勢力ね。\n有人機の残骸にブラックボックスが残ってた。", "zh": "『Tentacles』，是Frontier的独立势力。\n有人机的残骸中还留有黑匣子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "0d3af74bc7615bad70b30365622988598aa7a1a82b27be5c4012f1337052f19c", "ja": "有人機……。", "zh": "有人机……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "02fe3e39570dbb2ba6c8a71f3754194ba1294d4ddbda0d1a8eaf07397c2daa02", "ja": "まだ慣れない？　……そうだよね。\n訓練で人は撃たないから。", "zh": "还没习惯吗？……也是呢。\n毕竟训练时不会向人开枪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "7152211edf91d8b0ece991367a10bebac6cfb103e3ac8e3d626b8bdcf721585e", "ja": "うん……。機兵じゃなくて同じ人間なのに。\nどうして争うんだろう……。", "zh": "嗯……明明不是机兵，而是同样的人类。为什么要争斗呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "215713f6855eadc82c4d1236c450840166cc0e84a5b2dba2bb9b89262a390f92", "ja": "『テンタクルス』は人の統治を否定して、マザーAIに\n任せる思想。分かり合うのは、難しそうだから……。", "zh": "《坦塔克鲁斯》是否定人类统治、主张交由母亲AI管理的思想。因为看起来很难相互理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "b5c7dce9bcc1702b055454fbb9f9e05a2a52569e609e5b57bbbefd93dc6edccd", "ja": "ダメだね、私たちは。世界が一つになっても、\n空に新しい大地を作ってまで争いを続けてる……。", "zh": "不行啊，我们。即使世界合而为一了，也还是要在空中建造新的大地，继续争斗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "4972b9d2e08a377a5169158b0fb74b5dee8b36138c67b6cd9aee63682948ec83", "ja": "イク、ちょっといい？　戦闘記録を見たけど、\nまた有人機を墜としてないわね。", "zh": "育，方便聊一下吗？我看了战斗记录，你又没有击落有人机呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "aafdbbdf06dc856619f041427493dfc46f827360bd5062b5cf16da887383935b", "ja": "あ、はい……ごめんなさい、シホさん。\n上手く、当てられなくて……。", "zh": "啊，好的……对不起，志保。\n没能好好命中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a6015ee5dec4c8f9675c10e77da9584beee4ac09ae4af10b7831035aa7f025f", "ja": "撃てなくて、でしょう？　次は躊躇わないで。\nでないと、あなたが撃たれる側になる。", "zh": "是“没能开枪”，对吧？下次不要犹豫。\n不然，你就会变成被射击的一方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "28d73eba48a2c3cdc8e815a26114df7aa34efb7c5883d0188500a6c47e5eea9e", "ja": "それと、あなたの適合率だけど。\nこれ……。", "zh": "还有，你的适配率……\n这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "52a9c709a1e3adc6686f3862e3979ed097b588b022a8fb6dbef601759dc3dca5", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、シホ。\nイクのぶんもミキが撃つから。", "zh": "没事的，志保。\n育的那份也由美希来打。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "2c1a5c6d6ac36cf1d43f0329186b47c01bc1e5c321baa50adc66c047ebeb08ff", "ja": "機兵は全部、ミキが壊すから。\nそしたらこの戦争も終わるよね？", "zh": "机兵全部交给美希来破坏。\n这样一来，这场战争也会结束吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "87ff45a65abe0ef932d6b70c52718582c4d377634f1ec56562b0b6ff88d7a9ae", "ja": "戦争が、終わる……。\n機兵を、全部やっつけたら……！", "zh": "战争就会结束……。\n只要把机兵全部消灭……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "0c75a2b9f610dfaaa8fbf3c3cf85dc4800cfad7bfa4468f7cb9f7ff4e1cdd923", "ja": "またそんなこと……。わかってるでしょう。\n機兵は自己生産能力を持ってるんです。", "zh": "又在说这种话……你也明白的吧。\n机兵可是拥有自我生产能力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "c29e28f029e831ee4de425daf069415d8bd8f33bc3080a93e286f90089899922", "ja": "みんな先輩みたいにできるわけじゃない。\n先輩ひとりがいくら戦っても、終わりなんて……。", "zh": "大家又不可能都做到像前辈一样。\n就算前辈一个人再怎么战斗，也根本不会有结束的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "5559008e2ff942b59537cc42d3d1d7fb1c6f04496a43bf2fdff39b4284e33b4a", "ja": "ひとりじゃないよ？\nガーデンのみんながいるし。こわーい副隊長とか♪", "zh": "你不是一个人哦？\n花园里的大家都在呢。\n还有那个可怕的副队长♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "7638f51370e46ebae43b3cfe32d1ff0e8e3d1af0635b343e1acbb8a77ef7bad9", "ja": "だから……。\nああもう、いいです！", "zh": "所以……。\n啊，真是的，不用了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "5542e57f438c3399013db6a77b17b0c8ec0e84f0725c2f99589b134becf1d74f", "ja": "……ふふふっ！", "zh": "……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "5542e57f438c3399013db6a77b17b0c8ec0e84f0725c2f99589b134becf1d74f", "ja": "……ふふふっ！", "zh": "……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1029_null", "source_sha256": "80dd18bca424b54232785760c0ab1d0a9204b6fcc4da843ff351844b39d9efa9", "ja": "Archival record 003\n-Unidentified time-　かつてのある日(1)", "zh": "Archival record 003\n-Unidentified time-　过去的某一天(1)", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "aa15b83273148923efb2819b96ff82ee7d0ef5e754d785f47937499ba09488b9", "ja": "おかしい……？　イクちゃんが、ですか？", "zh": "奇怪……？是说小育吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "e3957c7bd4f3c8ff673da0c21c120012a6a8b383b01e02d5163070e20baede8a", "ja": "少なくとも不自然ね。適合率1000％近いなんて、\n才能の範囲を超えてる。", "zh": "至少很不自然。契合率接近1000％，\n已经超出才能的范畴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "602767509871dd469fb65300c88a9fd7a5d24e03252332f1cbb62b2ee0163d4d", "ja": "ユンゲルス機関を洗ってみましょう。\n評議会にも連絡を入れて。ここの回線、まだ使える？", "zh": "调查一下尤恩格尔斯机构吧。\n也联系一下评议会。这里的线路还能用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "7d12894d08ea01b6fd1036db9bfda4cf8ddf3cf298f4e7f312f7b000d3556f5a", "ja": "はい、生きてます。でも同期に関する技術は、\n私たちが先行していたはずでは……？", "zh": "是的，还能用。不过关于同步的技术，我们应该一直领先才对……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "0e0c0c87ccdfb7361d43da5848dc259506cb9da7c0c6fcda46a09601596b88d9", "ja": "情報漏洩はお互い様。……機関の根っこは、\nこちらと繋がってるようなものだし。", "zh": "信息泄露彼此彼此……毕竟那个机构的根基，就像是和我们相连一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "2b09f0e0d3495a3b7dac57ab6898f224c95fa2c2df7e5d66c7e109089ef6919f", "ja": "けど、もしユニオンが実用化させていたのなら……。\n潮時かもしれないわね。", "zh": "可是，如果联盟已经将其投入实用化……或许也到了该收手的时候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "cf5f5fa39fa792e00c9afba83a14ca532b064c96b745fb6036375454b2078f4c", "ja": "潮時……。シホさん、本当にいいんですか？\nリクだって、そんな……。", "zh": "时机已到……志保，真的没关系吗？\n就连莉琉也……那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "8112fc4eb363c0517f8afecab3f46d1fb110f27c94320ef7104202707aa6901f", "ja": "決まってるでしょ。止めるしかないの。\nでないと世界は、壊れていくだけよ。", "zh": "当然已经决定了。只能阻止他。\n否则，这个世界只会不断崩坏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_02_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "81dc1eb9f0684381cddff94d8a589772455d744222e6c62b0993f2b560af0370", "ja": "そんな明日にはしない……。させないわ。\n……安心して、エミリー。私はもう、迷ってないから。", "zh": "我不会让明天变成那样……也不会让它发生。\n……放心吧，艾米莉。我已经不再迷茫了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
